  {
    "id": "1246212",
    "original": "結局のところ「女らしさ」といふものは、女である以上誰でも備へてゐるのが当然で、努力をしてそれを示す必要もなく、また、意識的にそれを隠してもなんにもならない性質のものである。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "1246217",
        "text": "In the end, \"feminity\" is something that a woman is naturally furnished with, there is no need to make any effort to show it, and it's a quality such that even if one were to make conscious efforts to hide it, it would lead to nothing."
      }
    ],
